    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Krobus",
      "key": "Tue",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I am too sensitive to sunlight to go out on most days.#$b#The conditions in here are perfect.#$e#Care to buy anything?",
      "translation": "Na sluneční světlo jsem příliš citlivý, takže většinu dní nemohu vycházet ven.#$b#Zdejší podmínky jsou dokonalé.#$e#Nechceš si něco koupit?",
      "sourceSHA256": "dc7fbb8edf7d06944ff13d5c345eb9e1482cbb6de678644bf8d153f25bfe2771",
      "translationSHA256": "c6c6d2202c55a345742a7b1ad17ccb51b8b903a8668bd6ac6fba5c3de64dd841",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Krobus",
      "key": "Mon",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Please, don't be alarmed. I am different than the others.#$e#I've spent a lot of time observing humans. I know you like to shop. Care to see my wares?",
      "translation": "Prosím, nelekej se. Od ostatních se liším.#$e#Strávil jsem spoustu času pozorováním lidí. Vím, že máš nakupování v oblibě. Nechceš se podívat na mé zboží?",
      "sourceSHA256": "ef166f48905dea2985648c5a46509062b8ccf637fcbd2b07004af0875814d82a",
      "translationSHA256": "9a112c301fa2a0968438ab97b9446c04b19083484d7e0471f41cf05ac5e81e7e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Krobus",
      "key": "Mon2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Back again? I suppose it does fit into my theory of human behavior.",
      "translation": "Zase tady? Předpokládám, že to zapadá do mé teorie lidského chování.",
      "sourceSHA256": "35dcdbf7256a28f1a4bf43745f2207d1754cce4167731de557a945c406c5bd12",
      "translationSHA256": "e7cc78b88101e3cb9ea0b423096698eafad491f15bf75be31560452076e4abe2",
