    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Krobus",
      "key": "Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "On Fridays I stay silent as a sign of devotion to Yoba.",
      "translation": "V pátek mlčím na znamení oddanosti Yobovi.",
      "sourceSHA256": "52732653090c8e6a8d78fcb02db6b179456e1c8c6c9ec9ea1fda550d05c1bac5",
      "translationSHA256": "5eb33dd0fbaae55305deba17f6bbf180e0f0107c5aef30669160660fe74e2a2f",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Krobus",
      "key": "Sat4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'd love to see more of the outside world, but it wouldn't be safe for me.$s",
      "translation": "Rád bych viděl víc z vnějšího světa, ale nebylo by to pro mě bezpečné.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "cd56dd1dbd5bd05e47c72eefac2b33e0db1e72cbc40bb12f7a36a37c3101485b",
      "translationSHA256": "ef2ba6acd0ea25acd0c7613c01726ea17d8530cb9779f81e36b40ac53a197cfb",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Krobus",
      "key": "Sat8",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'll never know what it's like to be human... but talking to you, I feel like I understand it a little.",
      "translation": "Nikdy nepoznám, jaké je to být člověkem... ale když mluvím s tebou, mám pocit, že tomu trochu rozumím.",
      "sourceSHA256": "c1741a3a23fd989f1f22d3c10ebe84a77e93f3f63b9cceda03112b5289114f01",
      "translationSHA256": "79f938a8e3a9244f499995b6df740dffce13f0f3fbf12115ecb239702c5e099c",
      "reviewChecks": [
